            "notes": "If you hit your Take Aim shots and capitalized on damage you should have made plenty of money. Not going to spend all of it just yet.\n\n\n\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) increase WP 15%\n\n[Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) increase wp 10% and adds 5% cooldown reduction.\n\n[Redux](item_e27dc8d9-4fa9-4e55-bf9a-7a4b3532a0d8) If you can hit your Take Aim shots you are almost guaranteed 3 Revdraw shots thanks to Seekerpoint. You can get your abilities back real quick with this combo and just keep launching sticky bolts. \n\n\nObviously shields and bubbles put a damper on this so be sure to go for exposed characters. If you're good ad leading your shots you can ruin any airborne target's day.",
