            "notes": "Selling [Frenzy Amplifier](item_d4b0cfcb-14e9-4472-a688-680120217250) here to take on another significant wp boost.\n\n[The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) gives another 20% wp. You should be at [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) 55% now.\n\nTake Aim headshots are absolutely devastating.\n\nCapitalize on revdraw shots to keep you alive and refresh your cooldowns faster. \n\nIf I am playing close to the ground for survivability I typically fire a sticky bolt and hold down left click until the auto fire shots are done and then repeat.\n\nIf you are in the air just do your jump, sticky, dash, sticky, dash, sticky, hold fire on your way down and then take cover until abilities are refreshed (which shouldn't take long). You are now a sticky volley machine.",
