            "notes": "Still trying to decide the best power here. Seems kinda situational. If I decide that I almost always benefit from one more than others I'll update.\n\nGoing with [Deep Pockets](item_4e5d5d1d-2c0d-4f5e-9521-9f71bdb88e9e) for less frequent reloading. It's not fun to find yourself stuck unable to shoot because you are reloading.\n\nMOAR DAMAGE and CHAOS\n\n[Portable Zipline](item_f4907cd6-08dc-4a13-b8f8-66d1949d35be) Should be clutch here since you are now an elimination machine.\n\n[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) Another 10% power boost with a 10% cooldown reduction. Also giving you another 5% power stacking up to 3 times when using an ability. This puts you at over 100% wp potential.",
